3","source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Visible during applicable football games; a valid event ticket and current stadium policies may apply.","cost_status":"not_applicable","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"kstate-k-hill-whitewashing","subject_type":"tradition","entity_name":"K-Hill Whitewashing","title":"Refresh the Concrete K and S","subtitle":"Engineering students have maintained the hillside letters for generations","notes":"Learn the history from the roadside or join only through the authorized Tau Beta Pi service project; do not enter the hillside independently.","short_summary":"Annual brush clearing, litter pickup and whitewashing keep Manhattan’s K and S letters visible.","evidence_claim":"K-State Engineering reports that Tau Beta Pi members have cleared brush, collected trash and whitewashed K-Hill’s concrete K and S each fall since 1974.","source_url":"https://engg.k-state.edu/about/history/k-hill/","source_title":"K-Hill History | Carl R. Ice College of Engineering","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Hillside maintenance is an organized service activity; participate only with authorization and supervision.","cost_status":"not_applicable","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"kstate-official-ring-ceremony","subject_type":"tradition","entity_name":"Official K-State Ring Ceremony","title":"Receive the Ring in a Spring Ceremony","subtitle":"A formal handoff for qualified K-State ring recipients","notes":"If eligible and ordering a ring, confirm the current ceremony process with the Alumni Association well before the spring presentation.","short_summary":"K-State’s ring program culminates in an annual ceremony for new recipients rather than a simple retail pickup.","evidence_claim":"The K-State Alumni Association states that it sponsors a ceremony each spring for new recipients of the Official K-State Ring.","source_url":"https://www.k-state.com/shoppurple/officialkstatering.php","source_title":"The Official K-State Ring | K-State Alumni Association","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Participation is limited to eligible ring recipients and governed by the Alumni Association’s current arrangements.","cost_status":"purchase_required","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"kstate-higinbotham-gate-graduation-photo","subject_type":"tradition","entity_name":"Higinbotham Gate Graduation Photo","title":"Frame the Cap and Gown at the Gate","subtitle":"A commencement-season portrait at K-State’s limestone entrance","notes":"Bring academic regalia, use the public approach without blocking pedestrians and take turns composing the gate behind the graduate.","short_summary":"Graduates mark their transition from student to alum with a portrait at the campus’s wrought-iron gateway.","evidence_claim":"K-State documents taking a cap-and-gown photograph at Higinbotham Gate as a university tradition and notes the gate as a common graduation portrait setting.","source_url":"https://www.k-state.edu/about/who-we-are/traditions/","source_title":"Traditions | K-State | Kansas State University","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Use the gate from publicly accessible campus walkways and yield to pedestrians and scheduled activities.","cost_status":"not_applicable","under21_safe":true}],"warnings":[]}],"warnings":[]}
